{"unit_id":"lkw2731938298__DSH-jumeng-image-video-tool#feature-1","repo":"lkw2731938298/DSH-jumeng-image-video-tool","commit":"91a5679ee32384247d966caf153ef9d962810608","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"jumeng-media 的功能「模型查询」：对话工具列出聚梦可用模型，并可按 image 或 video 类型筛选。用户调用 list_models 并可指定 kind，返回模型 ID 与支持的端点类型。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:185-240"]}
{"unit_id":"lkw2731938298__DSH-jumeng-image-video-tool#feature-2","repo":"lkw2731938298/DSH-jumeng-image-video-tool","commit":"91a5679ee32384247d966caf153ef9d962810608","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"jumeng-media 的功能「图片生成」：使用提示词和可选参考图调用聚梦生图接口。通过 generate_image 触发，可设置模型、尺寸和张数；生成图片会下载或解码保存至输出目录，并返回本地路径。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:304-408","src/api.ts:194-219"]}
{"unit_id":"lkw2731938298__DSH-jumeng-image-video-tool#feature-3","repo":"lkw2731938298/DSH-jumeng-image-video-tool","commit":"91a5679ee32384247d966caf153ef9d962810608","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"jumeng-media 的功能「视频生成」：提交文生视频或参考素材视频任务，按配置间隔查询任务状态，完成后下载视频到输出目录。generate_video 接收提示词、画幅、清晰度、时长和参考素材，并返回文件路径与任务编号。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:412-529","src/api.ts:221-310"]}
